### 1. Get Tutor Availability Schedule (Public Route)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tutors/{{tutorId}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Create Availability Slot (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tutorId": "{{tutorId}}",
  "startTime": "2026-09-01T10:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-09-01T11:00:00.000Z"
}

###

### 3. Update Availability Slot (Protected)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{slotId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startTime": "2026-09-01T10:30:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-09-01T11:30:00.000Z"
}

###

### 4. Delete Availability Slot (Protected)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{slotId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json